<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-TOP 10 IN MILWAUKEE CART PRACTICE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-TOP 10 IN MILWAUKEE CART PRACTICE.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wisconsin 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top ten in</p>
<p>unofficial practice Friday for the Milwaukee 200 CART race</p>
<p>(tabulate by driver, country, chassis, motor, lap time):</p>
<p>1. Patrick Carpentier (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>20.397 seconds (182.144 mph/293.124)</p>
<p>2. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 20.405</p>
<p>3. Paul Tracy (Canada), Penske Mercedes-Benz, 20.572</p>
<p>4. Scott Pruett (U.S.), Reynard Ford, 20.634</p>
<p>5. Greg Moore (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 20.646</p>
<p>6. Raul Boesel (Brazil), Reynard Ford, 20.692</p>
<p>7. Parker Johnstone (U.S.), Reynard Honda, 20.838</p>
<p>8. Gil de Ferran (Brazil), Reynard Honda, 20.878</p>
<p>9. Michael Andretti (U.S.), Swift Ford, 20.949</p>
<p>10. Bobby Rahal (U.S.), Reynard Ford, 20.992</p>
</text>
